+/// physics per wall second. The waits below are wall time but stand for a simulated
+/// duration, so they divide by this. Deliberately 4 and not 6: on a loaded box the sim
+/// falls short of the ceiling, and a wait that expires early would cut a level short and
+/// report a solution as a failure. Raise it only with a rerun of the known solves.
+const int theSimSpeedup = 4;
